      "id": "claim_c37075096eff4dfdb2d19efe564b65fc",
      "statement": "Approval is required for exactly three hardcoded action types — submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file — evaluated solely by getApprovalActionType in the shared background controller; all other actions (reads, clicks, fills, upload_file, navigate, open_tab, non-gated batch items) execute without a prompt.",
