      "statement": "The MCP WebSocket client assigns a fresh actionUUID (action-<timestamp>-<random>) and approvalRequest true for submit_form, download_file, and fetch_resource; for perform_batch, addBatchActionApprovalMetadata assigns an actionUUID to every batch item and sets approvalRequest true only on submit_form items.",
