      "id": "claim_cf321164ccb648f283faf84b243f2263",
      "statement": "The extension background injects the content script and sends a show_brijio_approval message carrying actionUUID, actionType, origin, and timeoutMs; the content script renders a role=dialog banner with Approve, Approve session, and Deny buttons and returns the decision via sendResponse, while hide_brijio_approval removes the banner on timeout; the Chrome adapter coerces any unrecognized decision to deny so a broken banner cannot silently default to approval.",
