    {
      "id": "claim_815bff4212094fd6b7a84e2dc43c7b39",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md states the security invariant: preserve user-visible connection state and configured client-side action approval, and do not bypass approval checks; the implementation enforces it because the only execution path for a gated action goes through ensureApprovedAction, which fails closed rather than executing when the adapter, origin, or actionUUID is missing, the user denies, the timer fires, or the origin changes, with no auto-approval based on form contents or labels.",
